+## Selection
+Selected only when `00.kernel/00.00.10.work/00.md` names this file.
+This patch changes that line from `0011.contents/01.006.md` to `0011.contents/01.015.md`.
+Creating a higher contents file does not select it. `01.006.md` through `01.014.md` stay as they are.
+If `01.015.md` is not the next free contents version when Prime applies this patch, Prime renumbers this candidate and retargets that one sentinel line, and rebases this inventory onto the then-current published tree.
